      "slug": "why-autumn-leaves-change-color",
      "title": "秋叶为什么会变红变黄？颜色不是简单地“藏在绿色下面”",
      "status": "verified",
      "core_facts": [
        {"fact": "秋季叶片衰老时叶绿素分解加速，树木可回收其中的氮等营养。", "status": "verified", "sources": ["https://www.fs.usda.gov/Internet/FSE_DOCUMENTS/stelprd3817419.pdf", "https://harvardforest.fas.harvard.edu/education-opportunities/classic-outreach-resources/autumn-foliage-color/leaf-science/leaf-process/"]},
        {"fact": "黄色/橙色常来自原已存在的类胡萝卜素在叶绿素减少后显露。", "status": "verified", "sources": ["https://www.fs.usda.gov/Internet/FSE_DOCUMENTS/stelprd3817419.pdf", "https://harvardforest.fas.harvard.edu/education-opportunities/classic-outreach-resources/autumn-foliage-color/leaf-science/leaf-pigments/"]},
        {"fact": "许多红色秋叶的花青素是在衰老阶段新合成，糖分、光照和低温会影响其表达。", "status": "verified", "sources": ["https://harvardforest.fas.harvard.edu/education-opportunities/classic-outreach-resources/autumn-foliage-color/leaf-science/leaf-process/", "https://research.fs.usda.gov/treesearch/54143", "https://research.fs.usda.gov/treesearch/15618"]}
      ],
